<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner shipyard wins Japanese contract.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner shipyard wins Japanese contract.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Kvaerner ASA said on Friday its Kvaerner Kleven shipyard subsidiary had won a shipbuilding contract worth 320 million crowns ($47.4 million) with The Sanko Steamship Co. Ltd of Japan. ($ = 6.744 Norwegian Crowns)</p>
